<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>antiAFK</Major>
    <Description>This macro will make you move every few seconds so you dont get kicked out from game/server. While this macro works you can go away from computer. 
To make this macro work best bind it to any keybind u dont use while playing and when you go away from computer click it. 
When binding it go to operating mode and choose  "Run until pressed angain"
Works in any game! You need to have the game on screen otherwise it wont work!</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 26 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 864 ms
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 34 ms
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 14 ms
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 14 ms
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 34 ms
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 864 ms
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 864 ms
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 864 ms
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 5 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rust</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>